BT 1 0 0 1 0 40.4 Tm /F1 9.2 Tf 12.4 TL (I built ExamGate as a console program that simulates the final hours before an assignment deadline. The main problem) Tj T* (is not the screen; it is keeping uploads ordered, finding the active file for each student, supporting rollback, and marking) Tj T* (late submissions exactly. I implemented the core structures with arrays and linked nodes instead of Java collection) Tj T* (classes.) Tj T* ET
