BT 1 0 0 1 0 40.4 Tm 12.4 TL /F1 9.2 Tf .133333 .156863 .176471 rg (The completed program connects the generator, intake queue, priority dispatcher, registry, rollback service, AVL) Tj T* (timeline, and report service. With seed ) Tj /F2 9.2 Tf (20260725) Tj /F1 9.2 Tf (, the WP7 run generated 2,500 upload events for 800 students. The) Tj T* (full-buffer rule accepted 2,400 and rejected 100. It counted 1,600 accepted re-uploads, 36 rollbacks, and 400 late) Tj T* (uploads. Repeating the same run produced the same functional output.) Tj T* ET
